        a: 'Sorry about that! Tap Send a Message (or email prismocrowns@prismocrowns.com) with what you are trying to order and your practice name, and our team will send you a direct checkout link within one business day.' },
      { rx: /\b(distribut\w*|wholesale|resell\w*|dealers?|dealership|partnership|partner with|authorized agent|become an agent|sales agent|exclusive|importer|importing|suppliers?|supply (company|house)|brokers?|dental shop|sales rep\w*)\b/i,
