      samples: {
        en: 'Thanks for asking! We don\'t send samples or do lunch-and-learns, simply because there is nothing new to learn: Prismo Crowns use the same preparation, cementation and chairside workflow as the traditional silver stainless steel crowns you already place. They are made from surgical-grade 300-series stainless steel, and sizing is comparable to 3M. The only thing that is new is the color, created by our proprietary, patented process. The easiest way to see them in your own hands is the Intro Kit (48 crowns, sizes 3, 4 & 5), or a single Refill Pack (5 crowns) if you would like to start smaller.',
